{"id":"l8ym9clkqxpufpl7qf8sgqyal","title":"思想之书·1·1、逻辑、矛盾与自指","originalTitle":null,"summary":"逻辑自指是逻辑中的自我指向悖论，表现为逻辑定义指向自身，导致无法自我认识但可通过外指实现相对认识。逻辑自指存在于一切逻辑中，揭示了逻辑作为把握真理的局限性。外指则推动逻辑不断展开以认识自指，但自指的深渊无法被彻底填平，成为逻辑永恒的动力源泉。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=1767125&do=blog&id=1561534"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T02:58:36.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T07:21:12.958Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T07:21:12.958Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["研究成果"],"score":17,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"c54912e4-3039-4d46-ba6b-6c54767cdf3d","title":"逻辑自指悖论及发展动力研究"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"c54912e4-3039-4d46-ba6b-6c54767cdf3d","title":"逻辑自指悖论及发展动力研究"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"ftPcNRsxRqNk","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}